<BaseLayout title="Privacy | Les Buttes Holiday Cottages" description="Privacy information for the Les Buttes Holiday Cottages website."><div class="wrap"><PageIntro eyebrow="Privacy" title="Your privacy" intro="We collect only the information we need to run Les Buttes Holiday Cottages and keep in touch with people who ask to hear from us."/></div><section class="section-tight paper"><div class="narrow prose"><h2>Website data</h2><p>This website does not use advertising cookies or tracking pixels. Our hosting providers may process basic technical logs for security, reliability and operation of the website.</p><h2>Mailing list</h2><p>If you choose to join our mailing list, we collect your email address and, if you provide it, your first name. We also keep a record that you consented through the website and the date and time of that consent.</p><p>We use these details only to send occasional Les Buttes news, new season dates and special availability. Mailing-list details are stored using Amazon Web Services, including Amazon SES, on our behalf.</p><p>You can unsubscribe at any time using the unsubscribe option in an email, or by contacting us at <a href="mailto:info@lesbuttes.com">info@lesbuttes.com</a>. We will stop using your details for marketing when you unsubscribe.</p><h2>When you contact us</h2><p>If you email or telephone us, we use the information you provide to answer your enquiry and manage related correspondence.</p><h2>Airbnb and external links</h2><p>Bookings are handled by Airbnb. External services have their own privacy policies and are responsible for their own processing of personal information.</p><h2>Your information</h2><p>If you would like to ask what personal information we hold about you, correct it, or ask us to delete it where appropriate, email <a href="mailto:info@lesbuttes.com">info@lesbuttes.com</a>.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>For any privacy questions, email <a href="mailto:info@lesbuttes.com">info@lesbuttes.com</a>.</p></div></section></BaseLayout>
